{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>英國前球星碧咸（David Beckham）大仔布魯克林（Brooklyn Beckham）的美國豪門女星妻子妮歌娜佩絲（Nicola Peltz），於社交網站分享早前出席「巴黎時裝周」時所拍的照片，其中她與布魯克林在鏡頭前激吻放閃，留言表示：「巴黎的愛。」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T05:58:23.634758+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:45:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:38:00.447858+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"2df3ac010254095d6a8ebdae42e565c0e1898cb20d67b1fa688f4b2f9d626366","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}